# =============================================================================
# 6. Internal documentation and test fixtures, removed at the 2026-10-28 rebuild
# =============================================================================

# When this repository was rebuilt from a single clean commit, the docs tree and
# the test fixtures were deliberately curated out. A sync walks the client tree
# and would otherwise re-add every one of them, silently reversing that
# decision -- which is what this section exists to stop.
#
# None of these carry a credential (they were scanned); they are design notes,
# task lists, superseded specifications and sample documents. If any of them
# should be published, delete its rule here rather than copying the file in by
# hand, so the next sync agrees with the one before it.

# The eight documents the rebuild kept. These DO stay in sync with the client,
# so they are included before the catch-all below -- rsync takes the first
# matching rule, so order here is load-bearing.
+ /docs/FIRST_TICKET.md
+ /docs/GLOSSARY.md
+ /docs/ONBOARDING.md
+ /docs/READ ME dynadoc.md
+ /docs/README ABOUT XDDOC.md
+ /docs/README export to odt,ods...md
+ /docs/architecture.md
+ /docs/extensions.md

# Everything else the client carries under docs/ was curated out. A blanket
# `- /docs/` would have frozen the eight above as well, which is the mistake
# this shape avoids.
- /docs/**

# The rebuild kept no test fixtures at all, so this one is a clean sweep.
- /test/

- /FILE_WATCH_ARCHITECTURE.md
